## Copilot-native development package

Use [the Copilot workflow and client guide](copilot-guide.md) to select the role,
load the required procedural skill and pass a durable Task Packet/commit snapshot.
The package supplies ten named responsibilities and eight task skills when Copilot
is selected. Existing native files remain protected; reconcile their updated bodies
manually in the reviewed adoption PR. A handoff button does not establish reviewer
independence: start a separate reviewer session on the frozen snapshot.
